bovine gastrointestinal tract and in apple cider are different</article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>2004</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>4792</fpage><lpage>4799</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15294816</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/AEM.70.8.4792-4799.2004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Krogfelt</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hjulgaard</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sorensen</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><name><surname>Givskov</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>rpoS</italic> gene function is a disadvantage for <italic>Escherichia coli</italic> BJ4 during competitive colonization of the mouse large intestine</article-title><source>Infect Immun</source><year>2000</year><volume>68</volume><fpage>2518</fpage><lpage>2524</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10768939</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/IAI.68.5.2518-2524.2000</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ukena</surname><given-names>SN</given-names></name><name><surname>Westendorf</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Hansen</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Rohde</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Geffers</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Coldewey</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Suerbaum</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Buer</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gunzer</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The host response to the probiotic <italic>Escherichia coli</italic> strain Nissle 1917: specific up-r